    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d334">

                <pb facs="0464" n="384" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg384"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Vasquez to Mr.
                            Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the Dominican Republic</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1902-09-24"><hi rendition="#italic">September
                                24, 1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Sincerely regret accident to President Roosevelt, and hope there is no danger for
                    him.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. L. Vasquez</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
